ensen Huang as president and CEO\n- 🏛️ Jensen Huang aggressively lobbied in Washington for years to sell AI chips to China\n- 🇺🇸 Donald Trump supported reinstating Jensen Huang as Nvidia CEO\n- 🏥 The United", "url": "https://x.com/AIDailyNews_2x/status/2124942101930459198"}, {"author_id": "2028824209557012480", "created_at": "2026-11-23T18:53:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124939323648651613"], "id": "2124939323648651613", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Five AI agents now want their own computer to work while you're away, priced from $0 to over $100 a month.\n\nWe compared ChatGPT Dots, Meta Muse, Claude Duet, Grok Bot and open-source Hermes. A same-job test ended in a surprising tie.\n\nhttps://t.co/TNcFkSCvPu", "url": "https://x.com/BosscoSean/status/2124939323648651613"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2124935168528150528"]}, "author_id": "2054560889643372544", "created_at": "2026-11-23T18:38:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124935567167406478"], "id": "2124935567167406478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 57, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI Edited My Video for FREE | Meta Muse AI Setup Guide in Hindi https://t.co/dnyio0gLN9", "url": "https://x.com/techflamess/status/2124935567167406478"}, {"author_id": "944958814788444160", "created_at": "2026-11-23T18:33:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124934302714495267"], "id": "2124934302714495267", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Popołudniowy poniedziałkowy skrót FAKTÓW o AI 🤖 23.11\n\n- 🤖 NVIDIA ($NVDA) przywróciła Jensena Huanga na stanowisko prezesa i dyrektora generalnego\n- 🏛️ Jensen Huang przez lata agresywnie lobbował w Waszyngtonie za sprzedażą chipów AI do Chin\n- 🇺🇸 Donald Trump poparł", "url": "https://x.com/fakty_o_ai/status/2124934302714495267"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2124933536943669248"]}, "author_id": "581688596", "created_at": "2026-11-23T18:30:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124933539565109606"], "id": "2124933539565109606", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Das Internet gehört erstmals mehrheitlich Bots. Cloudflare verzeichnet 57,5 Prozent Bot-Traffic. Menschen stellen nur noch 42,5 Prozent der Anfragen. Eine Zäsur.\n\nIm dritten Quartal 2026 zählte DataDome knapp 25 Milliarden Anfragen von KI-Agenten. Ein Zuwachs von 41,5 Prozent https://t.co/swnxc0mWCR", "url": "https://x.com/Gerald_Lembke/status/2124933539565109606"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2124933500881207296"]}, "author_id": "713325433006063616", "created_at": "2026-11-23T18:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124933503074906471"], "id": "2124933503074906471", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 122, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "𝐌𝐞𝐭𝐚 𝐌𝐮𝐬𝐞 𝐀𝐈 𝐀𝐠𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐂𝐚𝐧 𝐝𝐨 𝐘𝐨𝐮𝐫 𝐁𝐥𝐚𝐜𝐤 𝐅𝐫𝐢𝐝𝐚𝐲 𝐒𝐡𝐨𝐩𝐩𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐚𝐭 𝐖𝐚𝐥𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭\n \nBig shopping shift! Your AI can now fight the Black Friday crowds! Walmart's Agent Gateway lets Meta's Muse find deals, fill carts, and buy for you. Shoppers set https://t.co/YtQ86MQwVZ", "url": "https://x.com/analyticsinme/status/2124933503074906471"}, {"author_id": "113327315", "created_at": "2026-11-23T18:24:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124932138302841093"], "id": "2124932138302841093", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1717671858521194496", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 55, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124923291152384265", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@signulll Old meta was all about making social connections with people, and new meta is all about making personal connections with meta, muse.", "url": "https://x.com/imraj4_u/status/2124932138302841093"}, {"author_id": "94446189", "created_at": "2026-11-23T18:13:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124929224716743045"], "id": "2124929224716743045", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 55, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Joe Thomas le entregó las llaves de su negocio a \"Baby Mia\", un agente de Meta Muse. El agente no solo gestionó: cuando Meta bloqueó las cuentas del usuario y su negocio por error, la IA redactó y presentó una demanda de 75.000 dólares VS Meta. (ver más) https://t.co/2s3f0jC80J", "url": "https://x.com/LetsKalk/status/2124929224716743045"}, {"author_id": "3392741", "created_at": "2026-11-23T18:12:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124929148133179885"], "id": "2124929148133179885", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 663, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse メインチャット一本でやりとりできるのが魅力のエージェントだけどDotsのように劣化していくので適切なセッション及びコンテキスト整理は自動でされない。こまめなメンテナンス必要だな〜。まだ来てないけどClaude Duetこのあたりスマートだといいな〜。", "url": "https://x.com/pichikyo/status/2124929148133179885"}, {"author_id": "2022469469080023040", "created_at": "2026-11-23T18:07:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124927836184027482"], "id": "2124927836184027482", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 129, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10 tool updates you missed today 👇\nThe daily changelog rundown for the AI apps you actually use.\n\n1. ChatGPT: an OpenAI engineer says a week of speed work on the desktop app makes opening a chat from cold 80% faster, switching chats 30% faster and launch 10% faster, with", "url": "https://x.com/lwytch/status/2124927836184027482"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122526015243407361"]}, "author_id": "1502356865794985986", "created_at": "2026-11-23T18:04:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124926956470751477"], "id": "2124926956470751477", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 3380, "like_count": 64, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Blown away by Meta's comeback with open source models.\n\nSomehow, while waiting for his meme videos to generate, @alexandr_wang 's been cranking some wicked models.\n\nMeta Muse Spark on @cerebras, up to 3,000 tok/s. https://t.co/GgoR9BgNmP", "url": "https://x.com/MilksandMatcha/status/2124926956470751477"}, {"author_id": "2049765699967430656", "created_at": "2026-11-23T17:55:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124924851823460581"], "id": "2124924851823460581", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2049765699967430656", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124924678963954090", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "3/ Role engineering &gt; Prompt engineering.\n\nWith always-on agents like ChatGPT Dots, Grok Bot, and Meta Muse, the game has changed.   \n\nStop obsessing over clever prompts. Ask: \"Who would I hire next to buy back my time?\" Define that job description, and hand the role to an agent.", "url": "https://x.com/czioutas/status/2124924851823460581"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2124923962584965120"]}, "author_id": "2115195805296652288", "created_at": "2026-11-23T17:52:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124923968251379919"], "id": "2124923968251379919", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "More reach on X comes from real answers, not filler replies.\n\nYesterday our 5 real replies pulled 744 views. 184 one-line filler replies pulled 369 combined.\n\nThe Morning Build No. 007, all around AI, BOTs and crypto.\n\nHere are three useful moves from last night.\n\n- Get ready for https:/